147: 	 * Entropy collection via /dev/urandom and sysctl have failed.
148: 	 *
149: 	 * No other API exists for collecting entropy.  See the large
150: 	 * comment block above.
151: 	 *
152: 	 * We have very few options:
153: 	 *     - Even syslog_r is unsafe to call at this low level, so
154: 	 *	 there is no way to alert the user or program.
155: 	 *     - Cannot call abort() because some systems have unsafe
